  nonce: 17ad  # 17ad
  message: "Fully closed. Primary symptom (multi-line description) was fixed in 9fb301083d on 2026-05-03 (single-line PR_DESCRIPTION + static regression test asserting no newlines in -o description= push options). The related swallowed-error mask on the Step 7 push was deferred at that time and is now fixed in PR #3662 — the push is wrapped in an if-not block that prints the captured output and exits 1 on push failure, so any future regression (network, auth, refspec rejection, schema change) propagates as a non-zero exit instead of falling through to a misleading success message. test_step7_push_does_not_swallow_errors enforces the invariant statically. No new awaits_bakeoff_validation tag — fix is fully covered by direct test, not a bakeoff-corpus regression delta."  # 17ad
